Directory for storing 'raw' files for analysis.

- HALO: MaxQuant (label-free, DDA) PSM/peptide/protein-level output and search
  parameters for the PER2-HALO vs HALO immunoprecipitation experiment.
- PROTAC: MaxQuant (TMT18-plex, DDA) PSM-level output for the PER2-PROTAC vs
  DMSO experiment, plus the experiment design and mTORC1 substrate reference
  tables used for annotation.
